# All of data/, at the author's request (D109): the NAS carries it, by sync-data.ps1, and the
# remote carries none of it. Anchored with the leading slash, because in course-lab a bare
# `data` rule swallowed other directories named data twice. WekaExt's root .gitignore has no
# rule over this tree at all, so every exclusion the track needs has to be stated here.
